### POST /transactions - Criar transação (Válida)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compras no mercado",
  "amount": 15000,
  "category": "GROCERIES"
}

### POST /transactions - Testar Validação (Erro 400 - valor negativo e sem descrição)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -50,
  "category": "FOOD"
}

### GET /transactions/summary - Obter Resumo Financeiro Geral e por Categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/summary

### GET /transactions/GROCERIES - Listar por categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/GROCERIES

### GET /transactions/PHARMA - Listar por categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/PHARMA

### GET /transactions/AUTO - Listar por categoria
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/AUTO

### POST /transactions/ai - Transcrever áudio e processar com IA
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/ai
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio11.m4a"

< ./src/test/resources/audio/audio11.m4a
--boundary--

### 1. Testar ChatClientController (/api/chat)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?prompt=Gere um registro de gasto no mercado com valor e local

### 2. Testar ChatModelController (/api/chat-model)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat-model?prompt=Gere um exemplo de orçamento mensal

